      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "CENTREFOLD STAR (7) added to a string of top-four results when tackling some handy rivals at her latest appearance. Freshened since and may need a bit of luck negotiating a very wide starting position but has the ability to take care of this field. PERFECT PLAYGIRL (2) put together some minor placings then was at her best last start when scoring by 2.5 metres over this distance at Kapunda. Should enjoy an economical run from this draw so could strike again. HOOKLINEANDSINKER (5) is race fit now and put the writing on the wall when he finished runner-up at Mildura a week-and-a-half ago. HUGH GO (6) has placed in both outings - one from this barrier - since winning here. Respect.",
